{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261104%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E6%88%BF%E5%8D%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%AB%98%E7%B4%9A%E7%B6%93%E7%90%86Aeon%E8%B6%85%E5%B7%BF%E5%81%B7%E7%89%9B%E6%89%92%E4%B8%89%E6%96%87%E9%AD%9A%E7%AD%89%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9-900x1024.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>42歲房協高級經理涉於太古城超巿內偷竊牛扒、三文魚和牛油果等食物，遭控一項盜竊罪，案件今（4日）在東區裁判法院首度提堂，她暫毋須答辯，案件押後至12月30日再訊，以待辯方索取文件及提供法律意見，被告准以500元保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告胡燕姍（42歲，報稱房協高級經理）被控於2026年8月13日，在太古城康怡廣場（南）永旺百貨內，偷竊1包西冷扒、1盒即食海蜇、1包湯包、1包咖哩扎肉、1包三文魚柳、1個牛油果、1包滷水大腸。</p>\n<p>法院：東區裁判法院<br/>被告：胡燕姍<br/>控罪：盜竊<br/>案件編號：ESCC2579/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:45:47.962554+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:11:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:20.405629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:38:20.981707+00:00","content_hash":"6e6edd8ad6b494eeeb5208718d6599fda585eac71cf2b115321b3b96b11a74e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}